thub.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-04-17T07:19:11Z","updated_at":"2025-04-21T13:31:12Z","closed_at":"2025-04-21T13:31:09Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible on the cutting edge of the master branch.\n- Not reproducible before commit `36a135ca62359e32ec8f0d20a4966bf517132eb4`.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - godot 4.5-dev compiled from source\n\n### Issue description\n\nI did some git bisecting and figured out that https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104451 introduced a regression which could cause canvas transforms to not update for many frames. This would result in visibly jittery canvas item updates. I have a potential fix prepared here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105482\n\nAfter that PR -- notice the white square jiggling as it tries to follow the sphere:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3aaa2ea9-c069-464f-91d5-144ee6bc4b44\n\nBefore that PR (and after the fix I have prepared already):\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1562a6fb-fb93-445f-be6b-9298adfd2136\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAn easy way to reproduce this is to use a script like this on a canvas item that's like a color rect or panel, and set it to follow a node3d in the scene and while moving a camera around.\n```gdscript\nextends Control\n\n@export var follow_target: Node3D\n\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n\tposition = get_viewport().get_camera_3d().unproject_position(follow_target.global_position)\n```\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[04-17-2025-canvas-jitter-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19790106/04-17-2025-canvas-jitter-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105483/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105483/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}